*> Corrigé TP3.1 : tableau de notes
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TP31.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-NB          PIC 99 VALUE 8.
01 WS-TABLE.
   05 WS-NOTE     PIC 99V99 OCCURS 8 TIMES.
01 WS-SAISIE      PIC X(10).
01 WS-I           PIC 99.
01 WS-J           PIC 99.
01 WS-TEMP        PIC 99V99.
01 WS-SOMME       PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-MOYENNE     PIC 99V99.
01 WS-MIN         PIC 99V99.
01 WS-MAX         PIC 99V99.
01 WS-AU-DESSUS   PIC 99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-ED          PIC Z9.99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-PRINCIPAL.
    PERFORM 1000-SAISIE
    PERFORM 2000-STATISTIQUES
    PERFORM 3000-TRI
    STOP RUN.

1000-SAISIE.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-NB
        DISPLAY "Note " WS-I " ? " WITH NO ADVANCING
        ACCEPT WS-SAISIE
        COMPUTE WS-NOTE(WS-I) = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-SAISIE)
    END-PERFORM.

2000-STATISTIQUES.
    MOVE WS-NOTE(1) TO WS-MIN WS-MAX
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-NB
        ADD WS-NOTE(WS-I) TO WS-SOMME
        IF WS-NOTE(WS-I) < WS-MIN
            MOVE WS-NOTE(WS-I) TO WS-MIN
        END-IF
        IF WS-NOTE(WS-I) > WS-MAX
            MOVE WS-NOTE(WS-I) TO WS-MAX
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    COMPUTE WS-MOYENNE ROUNDED = WS-SOMME / WS-NB
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-NB
        IF WS-NOTE(WS-I) > WS-MOYENNE
            ADD 1 TO WS-AU-DESSUS
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE WS-SOMME TO WS-ED
    DISPLAY "Somme      : " WS-ED
    MOVE WS-MOYENNE TO WS-ED
    DISPLAY "Moyenne    : " WS-ED
    MOVE WS-MIN TO WS-ED
    DISPLAY "Minimum    : " WS-ED
    MOVE WS-MAX TO WS-ED
    DISPLAY "Maximum    : " WS-ED
    DISPLAY "Au-dessus de la moyenne : " WS-AU-DESSUS.

3000-TRI.
    *> Tri à bulles décroissant
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I >= WS-NB
        PERFORM VARYING WS-J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-J > WS-NB - WS-I
            IF WS-NOTE(WS-J) < WS-NOTE(WS-J + 1)
                MOVE WS-NOTE(WS-J)     TO WS-TEMP
                MOVE WS-NOTE(WS-J + 1) TO WS-NOTE(WS-J)
                MOVE WS-TEMP           TO WS-NOTE(WS-J + 1)
            END-IF
        END-PERFORM
    END-PERFORM
    DISPLAY "Notes triees (decroissant) :"
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-NB
        MOVE WS-NOTE(WS-I) TO WS-ED
        DISPLAY "  " WS-ED
    END-PERFORM.
